"attachedFrame":"WxGswdF5QV65COZ5YYeJO","textBold":true,"rotation":347},{"id":"PWXBABxLV2PmxD_pasFmZ","type":"shape","kind":"rectangle","position":{"x":10720,"y":4860},"width":1720,"height":120,"fillColor":"#607d8b","text":"Methodenbeschreibung","textFontFamily":"Inter","textAlignment":"left","attachedFrame":"zsTcLCn4KewcTpa66vUua","textSize":56,"textColor":"#ffffff","textBold":true},{"id":"7M9laThbjG_rSVGrBLelv","type":"shape","kind":"rectangle","position":{"x":10740,"y":5030},"width":1680,"height":880,"fillColor":"transparent","text":"🚀 Probieren Sie selbst: Der Ablauf in 4 Schritten\n\n🎯 Wofür: Ein geschützter Ort, um die Werkzeuge kennenzulernen, bevor es ernst wird.\n\n1. Haftnotiz anlegen (2 Min.)\nAktion: Erstellen Sie eine Haftnotiz und schreiben Sie Ihren Namen darauf.\n\n2. Formen und Pfeile (3 Min.)\nAktion: Zeichnen Sie ein Rechteck und einen Kreis und verbinden Sie beide mit einem Pfeil.\n\n3. Gestalten (3 Min.)\nAktion: Ändern Sie Farbe, Schriftgröße und Ausrichtung.\n\n4. Gemeinsam arbeiten (5 Min.)\nAktion: Verschieben Sie gemeinsam Karten und beobachten Sie, wie Änderungen bei allen sofort erscheinen.\n\n🛠️ Ihre Rolle als Moderator\nMutmacher: Fehler sind hier ausdrücklich erlaubt.\nHelfer: Gehen Sie die Schritte einmal gemeinsam durch.\nAufräumer: Leeren Sie den Rahmen vor der nächsten Gruppe.","textFontFamily":"Inter","textAlignment":"left","attachedFrame":"zsTcLCn4KewcTpa66vUua","textSize":26,"textColor":"#000000"},{"id":"3DsulzNY7C9i4mNsw8iFZ","type":"shape","kind":"rectangle","position":{"x":12640,"y":4860},"width":1920,"height":120,"fillColor":"#ff5722","text":"METADATEN · T27 · wird vor Veröffentlichung entfernt","textFontFamily":"Inter","textAlignment":"left","attachedFrame":"oo7ra_3lUIr9bx7896q5t","textSize":44,"textColor":"#ffffff","textBold":true},{"id":"mRMuRQ2e-HDBdgO481lcK","type":"shape","kind":"rectangle","position":{"x":12640,"y":5000},"width":1920,"height":130,"fillColor":"transparent","text":"Template-ID: T27   ·   Datei: T27_try-it-yourself.de.nwb   ·   Board-Format: v2 (Infinite Canvas)\nQuelle: Beispiele.nwb › Rahmen 5\nAusfüllen: In „Ihr Eintrag\" eigenen Text schreiben oder ✓ setzen, um den Vorschlag zu übernehmen. Leer = noch offen.","textFontFamily":"Inter","textAlignment":"left","attachedFrame":"oo7ra_3lUIr9bx7896q5t","textSize":22,"textColor":"#000000"},{"id":"sJ43IJ9Cqpl0eTJlX-DED","type":"shape","kind":"rectangle","position":{"x":12640,"y":5150},"width":430,"height":60,"fillColor":"#607d8b","text":"Feld","textFontFamily":"Inter","textAlignment":"left","attachedFrame":"oo7ra_3lUIr9bx7896q5t","textSize":24,"textColor":"#ffffff","textBold":true},{"id":"q4ZlY_oqbw6_wg8tHyd1M","type":"shape","kind":"rectangle","position":{"x":13090,"y":5150},"width":690,"height":60,"fillColor":"#607d8b","text":"Vorschlag","textFontFamily":"Inter","textAlignment":"left","attachedFrame":"oo7ra_3lUIr9bx7896q5t","textSize":24,"textColor":"#ffffff","textBold":true},{"id":"4EMIYNLObjStZU6_ddVFZ","type":"shape","kind":"rectangle","position":{"x":13800,"y":5150},"width":760,"height":60,"fillColor":"#607d8b","text":"Ihr Eintrag","textFontFamily":"Inter","textAlignment":"left","attachedFrame":"oo7ra_3lUIr9bx7896q5t","textSize":24,"textColor":"#ffffff","textBold":true},{"id":"PQErZUTBKPfkcjnGHUfGx","type":"shape","kind":"rectangle","position":{"x":12640,"y":5218},"width":430,"height":93,"fillColor":"#d7dee2","text":"Veröffentlichen?\n[publish]","textFontFamily":"Inter","textAlignment":"left","attachedFrame":"oo7ra_3lUIr9bx7896q5t","textSize":24,"textColor":"#000000"},{"id":"W7kE-5a-dG-563IMQ41dJ","type":"shape","kind":"rectangle","position":{"x":13090,"y":5218},"width":690,"height":93,"fillColor":"#e6e6e6","text":"nein – leere Übungsfläche","textFontFamily":"Inter","textAlignment":"left","attachedFrame":"oo7ra_3lUIr9bx7896q5t","textSize":24,"textColor":"#000000","textItalic":true},{"id":"GUq35oWLdsD9MKogTMAbg","type":"shape","kind":"rectangle","position":{"x":13800,"y":5218},"width":760,"height":93,"fillColor":"#